################ issue python/mypy#19618
#19618 [OPEN] unexpected "var-annotated" when using constrained TypeVar
author: asottile-sentry  created: 2025-08-08T19:28:52Z  closed: null
labels: bug,topic-type-variables
--- body
<!--
