[sterliakov 2025-08-09] Yeah, this is a known problem. With constrained typevars mypy checks the body of function multiple times, once per constraint, and it's difficult to reconcile the results into inferred attr types reliably. Subset of #5416 (but maybe we should keep this open as having much better focus)
